 The Thing receives this, reads its internal sensor, and responds:

00:04:19.206 --> 00:04:28.029 
 The Consumer parses the JSON body and now has the "coffeeBeansLeft" value of 320 grams. Notice how each field

00:04:28.029 --> 00:04:34.044 
in the form had a direct counterpart in the request — the WoT form is essentially a declarative description of

00:04:34.044 --> 00:04:35.890 
the HTTP request.

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:40.017 
 Now the Consumer wants to invoke the "brewCoffee" action.

00:04:40.017 --> 00:04:46.874 
 The Consumer reads this form just like before — but now " href" starts with " coap", so it

00:04:46.874 --> 00:04:49.878 
knows to use CoAP instead of HTTP.

00:04:49.878 --> 00:04:53.601 
The "cov:method" field says "POST".

